  "brief": {
    "en": "A rested driver on an ordinary daytime highway, only just underway — drowsiness low (≈30, a few minutes in). With no fatigue pressure, the assistant leans on the driver's own j-pop/j-rock taste. Its partner preset is the SAME driver after a long monotonous stretch — watch the pick change.",
    "ja": "休息十分なドライバーが昼間の高速を走り始めたところ — 眠気は低い（約30、走行数分）。疲労の圧力がないため本人のJ-POP/J-ROCK嗜好が主導。対のプリセットは長い単調区間の後の同一ドライバー — 選曲の変化に注目。"
  },
